<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL unit 300 mln mark notes.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL unit 300 mln mark notes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Monday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to DSL Finance NV Amsterdam's 300 million mark 4.5 percent notes due 2000.</p>
<p>IBCA said the issue was guaranteed by Bank Deutsche Siedlungs-und Landesrentenbank (DSL Bank).</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
